# LF everywhere, also in a Windows checkout (Biome checks line endings, and the fixtures are parsed byte for byte).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
# Batch files that QuietApply writes are generated at run time; any checked-in ones keep CRLF.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
